<v Daniel  Alarcón>Short pass to [? Navarrete. ?] He passes to [INAUDIBLE]. Chino Rivera heads it. OK, so this is the part where I was like, Dad, you're really playing with our emotions here.
<v Daniel  Alarcón>短传给 [? Navarrete ?]。他传球给 [INAUDIBLE]。奇诺·里维拉头球。好的，这就是我心想“爸爸，您真的在玩弄我们的情绪”的地方。

