<v Ira Glass>对，所以它反弹出来了。

00:56:27.440 --> 00:56:28.630
<v Daniel Alarcón>Right.
<v Daniel Alarcón>对。

00:56:28.630 --> 00:56:30.190
<v Renato>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Renato>（西班牙语演讲）

00:56:30.190 --> 00:56:40.230
<v Daniel  Alarcón>Back in the field, [? Terry-- ?] [? Terry ?] scores.
<v Daniel  Alarcón>回到场上，[? Terry-- ?] [? Terry ?] 进球了。

00:56:40.230 --> 00:56:41.410
<v Renato>Goal!
<v Renato>进球了！

00:56:41.410 --> 00:56:44.540
<v Ira  Glass>People are so excited.
<v Ira  Glass>人们太兴奋了。

00:56:44.540 --> 00:56:46.030
<v Renato>Goal!
<v Renato>进球了！

00:56:46.030 --> 00:56:49.860
<v Daniel   Alarcón>Giant chills, man. [SPANISH]
<v Daniel   Alarcón>巨大的寒意，伙计。（西班牙语）

00:56:49.860 --> 00:56:53.130
<v Renato>Peru, uno. Brazil, zero.
<v Renato>秘鲁，一。巴西，零。

00:56:53.130 --> 00:56:55.360
<v Ira Glass>I feel excited.
<v Ira Glass>我感到很兴奋。

00:56:55.360 --> 00:56:58.270
<v Daniel Alarcón>That's great. That's great. See? It works.
<v Daniel Alarcón>太棒了。太棒了。看到了吗？它起作用了。

00:56:58.270 --> 00:57:05.760
<v Ira Glass>It's funny to think that if he had actually been great at soccer, that moment on stage never would have happened.
<v Ira Glass>如果他真的在足球方面表现出色，舞台上的那一刻永远不会发生，这很有趣。

00:57:05.760 --> 00:57:11.700
<v Daniel Alarcón>Right, right. Yeah, yeah. I mean, they might have been singing songs about him, you know?
<v Daniel Alarcón>对，对。是的，我是说，他们可能会唱关于他的歌，您知道吗？

00:57:11.700 --> 00:57:14.170
<v Ira  Glass>Oh, somebody else would be.
<v Ira  Glass>噢，别人也会唱的。

00:57:14.170 --> 00:57:17.190
<v Daniel Alarcón>Yeah, some other kid would have been on stage, and--
<v Daniel Alarcón>是的，会有另一个孩子在舞台上，而且——

00:57:17.190 --> 00:57:19.900
<v Ira Glass>Yeah.
<v Ira Glass>是的。

00:57:19.900 --> 00:58:35.570
<v Ira  Glass>Daniel Alarcon-- he first told this story on his show, Radio Ambulante.
<v Ira  Glass>丹尼尔·阿拉孔——他首次在他的节目《Radio Ambulante》中讲述了这个故事。

00:58:35.570 --> 00:58:39.930
<v Common>Close your eyes for a moment. Yes, close them.
<v Common>闭上眼睛一会儿。是的，闭上它们。

00:58:39.930 --> 00:58:44.930
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
